---
layout: layout.njk
permalink: /artifacts/
title: Artifacts
description: The sketches, screenshots and files kept from building Jamie Thingelstad’s projects. Each one belongs to its project and stays on its page.
---
{% from "macros.njk" import shelf, artifactFigure %}
{#- A shelf for each thing with a large set, a figure for each with a small one. The picks and counts are in
    collection/site.ts (artifactSet). Every figure leads to the artifact's own address on its thing's page. #}
<section class="intro has-character">
  <a class="thingy-companion" href="/things/thingy-model/" aria-label="Meet Thingy’s character"><img src="https://thingy.thingelstad.xyz/character/latest/poses/workshop-hammer-show.webp" width="170" height="170" alt="Thingy, the Workshop Builder, holding up a hammer" /></a>
  <h1>Artifacts</h1>
  <p class="lede">{{ site.artifactTotal }} pieces kept from the building: first sketches, icon studies, screenshots from the first day, a poster, a sign. They belong to the projects, and every one of them stays on its project’s page too.</p>
</section>
<blockquote class="pull-quote"><q>I absolutely adore that Things I’ve built has a place to capture artifacts of the building process</q> <a href="/interviews/session-5/#q34">Jamie, question 34</a></blockquote>
{% for set in site.artifactSets %}{% if set.count >= 9 %}
{% call shelf("artifacts-" + set.thing.id, set.thing.title, set.note, 300, set.thing.artifactsPage or (set.thing.page + "#artifacts"), "See all " + set.count) %}
  {% for artifact in set.picks %}{{ artifactFigure(set.thing, artifact) }}{% endfor %}
{% endcall %}
{% endif %}{% endfor %}
<section class="year-section" id="smaller-sets">
  <h2>Smaller sets</h2>
  <div class="artifact-grid">
    {% for set in site.artifactSets %}{% if set.count < 9 and set.picks.length %}
    <div>
      {{ artifactFigure(set.thing, set.picks[0]) }}
      <a class="more" href="{{ set.thing.page }}#artifacts">{{ set.thing.title }}, {{ set.count }}</a>
    </div>
    {% endif %}{% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
<script type="module" src="{{ assets.enhance }}"></script>
